cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Movement Viewer"
abstract: >
  A standalone stereo / mono video browser with frame-accurate scrubbing,
  variable playback speed (0.01x to 120x), zoom + pan, and trim + crop +
  re-encode export to MP4.  Designed for clinical research where a quick
  visual review of finger-tapping or gait videos is needed without any
  database, subject management, or computer-vision pipeline.
authors:
  - family-names: Newbold
    given-names: Dillan
repository-code: https://github.com/newboldd/Movement-Viewer
license: BUSL-1.1
type: software
